## 🤝 Contributing & Community

You can support the project and help it grow:

* **Join our Telegram:** [TaskSlice Community](https://t.me/+Ue7mvAoJfjs3YTFi) — discuss features and get updates.
* **Report Bugs:** Open an [Issue](https://github.com/Mint-Company/TaskSlice/issues) if you find any problems.
* **Feedback:** We are always open to suggestions!